&TRACE OFF
*
* WHOIS EXEC - simple WHOIS client for VM/CMS
*
* Lynn Wheeler - v1.0 - 27 Feb 2001
*
&GOTO .START
.USAGE
&TYPE
&TYPE Usage: WHOIS name [server]
&TYPE
&EXIT 1
.START
&STACK FIFO
&READ VARS &1 &2 &3
&IF '&1' EQ '' &GOTO .USAGE
&IF '&2' EQ '' &DATA WHOIS.ARPA
&IF '&2' NE '' &DATA &2
&READ VARS SERVER
&IF '&3' NE '' &PUNCH &1 &2 &3
&IF '&3' EQ '' &PUNCH &1
PUNCH
&READ VARS
PIPE <PUNCH>
 | SPECS 1-* 1 /&/ 172 A
 | NETVIEW TCPCLI &SERVER 43
 | CONSOLE
&EXIT 0